Introduction
============

About
-----

The ``nisyscfg`` package provides a Python API for interacting with NI System
Configuration.

NI created and supports this package.

Operating System Support
------------------------

``nisyscfg`` supports Windows and Linux operating systems.

Python Version Support
----------------------

``nisyscfg`` supports CPython 3.11+.

Installation
------------

You can directly install the ``nisyscfg`` package using ``pip`` or by listing it
as a dependency in your project's ``pyproject.toml`` file.